# 与 stepby-axum 同一口径：`.editorconfig` 声明 `end_of_line = lf`，但仓里没有本文件时
# `core.autocrlf=true` 的 Windows 检出会把 .ts/.vue/.mjs 写成 CRLF。测试里存在跨行
# `includes(...)` 断言（以及 `tests/e2e/*.sh` 之类给 bash 执行的脚本），换行随平台变化
# 会让同一份代码在两台机器上给出不同结论 ⇒ 检出即 LF。
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
